UPDATE companies SET description='Form Plastics Company is based in St. Charles, Illinois, and was founded in 1969. The company began by manufacturing custom thermoformed rigid plastic containers for food applications and has since expanded into a broader packaging solutions provider.

Today Form Plastics produces plastic and paper food trays, lidding and overwrap films that are converted and slit in-house, and a line of tray sealing machines ranging from manual to fully automatic models. The company also builds hinged paperboard sealing equipment and auxiliary packaging machinery, and supports customers with consulting, in-house CAD design, on-site training, and preventative maintenance programs.

Its primary customers operate in food service, school nutrition, and healthcare institutional dining, as well as non-food packaging markets.

