UPDATE companies SET description='Formula Dynamics operates from Las Vegas, Nevada, where it has run a performance parts business for over two decades before adding service bays. The company began as a specialist supplier of exhaust systems, tuning components, and genuine OEM parts for brands such as Ferrari, Maserati, and Lamborghini, eventually becoming the exclusive North American importer and distributor for Larini Systems exhausts. That parts pedigree led to the opening of a workshop that now handles maintenance, repair, tuning, and upgrades for the same exotic platforms.

The shop delivers factory-level service and performance work across nine makes — Ferrari, Maserati, Porsche, Lamborghini, McLaren, Aston Martin, Mercedes, Bentley, Rolls-Royce, and Audi. Capabilities include exhaust fitting and valve-controller setup, ECU and dyno tuning with baseline documentation, big-brake and carbon-ceramic servicing, forged-wheel sourcing with touchless mounting and road-force balancing, coilover installation with corner-weighting and alignment, dry-ice blasting for underbody and engine-bay restoration, paint correction, ceramic coating, and paint-protection film, plus turbo-system integration with supporting fueling and cooling hardware. A dyno cell, touchless tire equipment, and dry-ice blasting gear support the work, while the parts store continues to ship components worldwide.

The company says its differentiator is a “baseline first, platform correct, prove the result” discipline: every car receives a health check before modifications, all fluids and torque specs follow manufacturer procedures, and dyno sheets plus road tests verify the outcome. Membership at Spring Mountain Motorsports Ranch provides track validation for parts and setups. Because parts sourcing, installation, and calibration share one roof, the shop avoids finger-pointing between supplier and installer, and it maintains documentation to collector standards for each vehicle’s history file.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Exhaust system installation and valve-controller setup", "ECU tuning and dyno tuning with baseline documentation", "Big brake kit and two-piece rotor installation", "Carbon-ceramic brake system service", "Forged wheel sourcing and touchless mounting", "Road-force balancing and TPMS service", "Coilover installation, corner weighting, and performance alignment", "Front-lift system installation", "Dry ice blasting for underbody and engine bay restoration", "Paint correction, ceramic coating, and paint protection film application", "Turbocharger and intercooler upgrades with integrated dyno calibration", "Supporting fueling and cooling hardware installation", "Routine maintenance (oil services, brake jobs, tire changes)", "Performance parts distribution (exhaust, suspension, tuning, OEM)"], "industries": ["Exotic automotive service", "Luxury automotive service", "Performance parts distribution", "Automotive aftermarket"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Dyno", "Touchless wheel mounting equipment", "Road-force balancer", "TPMS service tools", "Dry ice blasting system"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Baseline inspection before any upgrade work", "Dyno-documented tuning with before-and-after records", "Platform-correct fluids, parts, and torque specifications", "Documentation prepared to collector standards for vehicle history files", "Parts sourcing, installation, and calibration under one roof"], "facts_used": ["Location: Las Vegas, NV -> /", "Founded over 20 years ago as parts business -> /about", "Exclusive North American importer/distributor for Larini Systems -> /about", "Services nine makes: Ferrari, Maserati, Porsche, Lamborghini, McLaren, Aston Martin, Mercedes, Bentley, Rolls-Royce, Audi -> /about", "Workshop philosophy: baseline first, platform correct, prove the result -> /about", "Member of Spring Mountain Motorsports Ranch -> /about", "Parts store ships worldwide -> /", "Dyno tuning with baseline documentation -> /services", "Touchless mounting, road-force balancing, TPMS service -> /services", "Dry ice blasting for underbody/engine bay -> /services", "Paint correction, ceramic coating, PPF -> /services", "Turbo upgrades with integrated calibration -> /services", "Carbon-ceramic brake service -> /services", "Coilover installation, corner weighting, alignment -> /services", "Front-lift system installation -> /services", "Routine maintenance (oil, brakes, tires) -> /services", "Documentation to collector standards -> /about", "One accountable team for parts, installation, calibration -> /about"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "maintenance, repair, tuning, and upgrade work for exotic and luxury vehicles", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='formula-dynamics' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Four Star Foods, Inc. operates from Chicago, Illinois, where it recently relocated to a facility near the International Produce Market after decades in the historic Fulton Meat Market.

The company functions as both a wholesale distributor and a USDA-inspected processor (establishment P18395/M2514), supplying poultry, pork, beef, seafood, and other proteins. It offers specialty cutting services, runs a temperature-controlled truck fleet with CDL-licensed drivers for five-day-a-week delivery, and provides freezer rental.

Four Star Foods serves grocery stores, retail outlets, restaurants, and food-service establishments across Chicago, Milwaukee, and Northwest Indiana. Its vendor partnerships include Midwestern farmers, though specific brand names are not listed.

The company emphasizes supply-chain value and long-term customer relationships, rooted in its multi-generational family heritage in the Chicago meat trade. Its USDA partnership ensures that both facility and products meet rigorous federal standards, and it highlights an employee-focused culture with competitive compensation, retirement, and health benefits.', certifications=ARRAY['USDA establishment P18395/M2514']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Wholesale distribution", "USDA-regulated meat processing", "Specialty cutting", "Temperature-controlled delivery", "Freezer rental"], "industries": ["Grocery", "Retail", "Restaurant", "Food service"], "materials": ["Poultry", "Pork", "Beef", "Seafood", "Other proteins"], "equipment": ["Temperature-controlled trucks"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Four generations of family experience in Chicago meat wholesaling", "USDA-inspected processing facility (P18395/M2514)", "Temperature-controlled delivery fleet with CDL drivers", "Freezer rental available", "Serves Chicago, Milwaukee, and Northwest Indiana"], "facts_used": ["Company name, location, and service area -> homepage", "Family-owned, four generations, Fulton Meat Market history -> /about", "Wholesale distributor and USDA processor with establishment number -> /about", "Delivery fleet, CDL drivers, five-day delivery -> /about", "Specialty cutting, freezer rental -> /about", "Customer types: grocery, retail, restaurant, food service -> /about", "Employee culture and benefits -> /about", "Vendor partnerships with Midwestern farmers -> /about"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Four Star Foods is a reliable wholesale distributor & trusted processor of quality poultry & other proteins.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='four-star-foods' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Fourbital Factory operates from Burlington, Vermont, where it designs and produces custom beanies entirely in-house. The company does not disclose its founding year or ownership structure, but it presents itself as a Vermont-based manufacturer focused on domestic production.

The factory specializes in custom knit beanies, offering private-label, small-batch, and scaled production programs. Capabilities include 1×1 and 3×1 rib, chunky rib, and custom jacquard knitting in acrylic or merino wool, with over 40 acrylic and 15 wool color options. Finishing services cover embroidered patches, woven labels, pom-poms, and custom packaging. The vertically integrated workflow moves from design through prototyping (about one week) to full production (three to five weeks) and shipping (three to seven business days), with minimums as low as 25 units.

Fourbital serves a broad range of clients, including apparel and outdoor brands, retail collections, subscription boxes, ski resorts, breweries, universities, nonprofits, hospitality groups, sports teams, and corporate merchandise programs. A noted case study highlights a partnership with Darn Tough, transforming leftover sock yarn into wool beanies. The company also supports emerging brands, Kickstarter campaigns, and seasonal collaborations through its low-minimum model.

The company emphasizes quality, flexibility, and true partnership, positioning its domestic, small-batch approach as an alternative to overseas production. By keeping manufacturing local, Fourbital aims to move quickly, communicate clearly, and deliver craftsmanship that sets clients’ products apart, while supporting local jobs and offering “100% tariff-proof” production.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom knit beanie manufacturing", "Private label manufacturing", "Small batch production", "Custom jacquard knitting", "Embroidered patch application", "Custom label sewing", "Pom pom attachment", "Design consultation", "Prototyping", "Packaging and finishing", "Custom rib knitting (1x1, 3x1, chunky)", "Knit-in graphics and text", "Custom colorway development"], "industries": ["Apparel brands", "Outdoor brands", "Retail collections", "Subscription boxes", "Corporate merchandise", "Ski resorts", "Breweries", "Universities", "Nonprofits", "Events", "Emerging brands", "Product launches", "Seasonal collections", "Collaborations", "Kickstarter campaigns", "Growing apparel brands", "Established retailers", "Multi-location businesses", "Annual merchandise programs", "Bookstores & gift shops", "Hospitality", "Sports teams"], "materials": ["Acrylic yarn", "Merino wool yarn"], "equipment": [], "volume": "Minimums 25\u201350 units; scalable production", "lead_time": "4\u20136 weeks standard; prototype ~1 week, production 3\u20135 weeks, shipping 3\u20137 business days", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Low minimums as low as 25 units", "Standard turnaround 4\u20136 weeks", "100% manufactured in Vermont, USA", "Vertically integrated, small-batch focused", "Tariff-proof domestic production"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Burlington, Vermont -> db", "Custom beanie manufacturer, made in Vermont -> /", "Low minimums 25 units -> /", "Turnaround 4-6 weeks -> /", "Vertically integrated factory -> /", "Tariff-proof domestic production -> /", "Materials: acrylic and merino wool -> /", "Knit types: 1x1 rib, 3x1 rib, chunky rib, custom jacquard -> /", "Finishing: patches, labels, pom poms, embroidery -> /", "Production timeline: prototype 1 week, production 3-5 weeks, shipping 3-7 days -> /", "Industries served: apparel, outdoor, retail, subscription, ski resorts, breweries, universities, nonprofits, hospitality, sports teams, corporate -> /", "Case study with Darn Tough -> /", "Deposit $500 non-refundable -> /", "Sister brand 4T2D Apparel -> /", "Conscious production supporting local jobs -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Fourbital Factory is a Vermont-based custom beanie manufacturer focused on quality, flexibility, and true partnership.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "25\u201350 units", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='fourbital-factory' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Fox Valley Metal Fab, Inc. operates in Appleton, Wisconsin. The business began as Hietpas Welding, Inc., founded by Bruce Hietpas. On December 6, 2019, Clint La Rue acquired the company from Hietpas, who continues to contribute expertise and estimating support. The firm now trades under the Fox Valley Metal Fab name.

The shop delivers full-service welding, machining, and fabrication. Welding capabilities span TIG, MIG, stick, and gas processes, performed by certified welders on all metal types. Machining includes milling and lathe work. Fabrication services cover shearing, forming, rolling, punching, plasma cutting, and pipe bending. Structural fabrication produces stairs, platforms, canopies, and handrails. The company also provides mobile, on-site welding and repair. Facility size, headcount, and production volumes are not disclosed.

The company serves customers needing custom metal fabrication and welding, including structural and decorative projects. Jobs of any size are accepted.

Fox Valley Metal Fab emphasizes a customer-first philosophy, aiming to provide courteous, professional service. It cites continuous equipment upgrades to remain competitive and notes that its certified welders enable it to handle projects of any scale.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["TIG welding", "MIG welding", "Stick welding", "Gas welding", "Mobile/on-site welding", "Milling", "Lathe work", "Shearing", "Forming", "Rolling", "Punching", "Plasma cutting", "Pipe bending", "Structural fabrication (stairs, platforms, canopies, handrails)", "Custom fabrication"], "industries": [], "materials": ["All metal types"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Certified welders for jobs of any size", "Mobile on-site welding and repair services", "Ongoing equipment upgrades to stay competitive", "Customer-first service philosophy"], "facts_used": ["Location: Appleton, Wisconsin -> db", "Ownership change: Clint La Rue purchased Hietpas Welding from Bruce Hietpas on December 6, 2019 -> /", "Services: welding (TIG, MIG, stick, gas), machining (milling, lathe), fabrication (shearing, forming, rolling, punching, plasma, pipe bending), structural fabrication (stairs, platforms, canopies, handrails) -> /services", "Certified welders, all metal types -> /services", "Mobile/on-site welding services -> /", "Company objectives: customer-first, continuous equipment upgrades -> /about-us", "No job too large or small -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Fox Valley Metal Fabrication offers full-service welding, machining and fabrication.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='fox-valley-metal-fab-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
