UPDATE companies SET description='Frontgrade Colorado Springs LLC operates from Colorado Springs, Colorado, drawing on more than six decades of heritage in harsh-environment electronics. The company traces its lineage to technologies that have supported every crewed U.S. space mission from Apollo 11 through Artemis II, though a specific founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed.

