UPDATE companies SET description='Founded over 25 years ago in Westfield, Indiana, G&G Fabrication & Welding is a Latino-owned small business led by founders Cesar Guerrero (vice president) and Augusto Guerrero (president). The company began as a custom metal fabrication and light manufacturing shop serving the surrounding communities of Carmel, Noblesville, Fishers, and the greater Indianapolis area.

The shop provides a full range of metalworking services: CNC plasma cutting on an STV table, certified welding (including aluminum), shear and saw cutting, press-brake forming and bending, punching on a GEKA ironworker, and finishing such as powder coating, galvanizing, and sandblasting. They handle projects from one-off custom pieces to larger production runs, managing design through installation under one roof.

Customers span industrial, commercial, and everyday applications. Concrete examples include a custom display sign for Machos Barbershop, a support frame for a large island countertop, trailer repairs, and sprinkle-guard prototypes. The company emphasizes collaboration with other local small businesses and serves both B2B and individual clients across central Indiana.

The Guerrero name — meaning "warrior" — reflects a stated philosophy of tackling any challenge head-on. The firm differentiates itself with end-to-end service, over two decades of fabrication experience, and a commitment to precision equipment and local partnership.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["CNC plasma cutting", "Certified welding", "Aluminum welding", "Shear cutting", "Saw cutting", "Press brake forming and bending", "Punching (GEKA ironworker)", "CNC punching and forming", "Powder coating", "Galvanized finishing", "Sandblasting", "Installation", "Design assistance", "Precision mass production"], "industries": ["Industrial", "Commercial", "Small business", "Local business"], "materials": ["Steel", "Aluminum", "Stainless Steel"], "equipment": ["STV CNC Plasma Table", "GEKA ironworker machine", "Press brake"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Full-service from design and cutting to welding and installation", "Over 25 years of metal fabrication expertise", "State-of-the-art STV CNC plasma table and GEKA ironworker", "Small business focused on local collaboration", "Precision aluminum welding and certified welding capabilities"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Westfield, Indiana -> db", "Founders: Cesar Guerrero (VP & Founder), Augusto Guerrero (President & Founder) -> /", "Ownership: Latino-owned, small business -> /", "Experience: Over 25 years -> /", "Processes: plasma cutting, welding, shear/saw cutting, forming, punching, finishes -> /", "Equipment: STV CNC Plasma Table, GEKA ironworker, press brake -> /", "Materials: Steel, Aluminum, Stainless Steel -> /", "Industries: industrial, commercial, everyday applications -> /", "Customer examples: Machos Barbershop sign, countertop frame, trailer repairs, sprinkle guard prototypes -> /, /capabilities", "Differentiators: full-service, experience, equipment, local collaboration -> /capabilities"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_pr