UPDATE companies SET description='Gebco of Hawaii, a division of IdentiSys Inc., operates from Honolulu, Hawaii. The company has served the Hawaiian islands for over four decades, though a precise founding year is not publicly disclosed. As part of IdentiSys—described as North America''s largest full-service identification and security solutions provider—Gebco covers all major islands including Oahu, Maui, the Big Island, Kauai, Molokai, and Lanai.

The firm supplies and services a broad portfolio of identification, access control, and document-finishing equipment. Gebco also provides custom design services, on-site installation and maintenance, depot repair, and professional services such as card personalization and software integration.

Gebco serves a diverse set of verticals: corporate offices, educational institutions, financial services, gaming, government, healthcare, hospitality, industrial and manufacturing, membership and loyalty programs, retail, and transportation. Typical applications range from campus one-card programs and visitor management to patient identification, financial instant issuance, and asset tracking.

