UPDATE companies SET description='GenPro Energy Solutions is headquartered in Piedmont, South Dakota. The company was founded over two decades ago by Dwight Patterson in Rapid City, South Dakota, and remains privately held.

GenPro operates as a solar engineering, procurement, and construction (EPC) firm, delivering turnkey renewable energy projects including utility-scale solar arrays, community solar, battery storage, microgrids, and electrical and civil construction. The company manages projects ranging from 250 kW to 20 MW and employs over 110 skilled workers, reporting 224% revenue growth from 2022 to 2024.

Its clients span commercial, industrial, municipal, and utility sectors, with completed projects such as Long Meadow Dairy, Norfolk Community Solar, City of Schuyler Phase III Solar, and Clinton Solar 2B LLC.

GenPro emphasizes its roots in electrical craftsmanship, a workforce development program that pays significantly above regional averages, and a focus on mid-market solar projects. The company cites its NABCEP and OSHA certifications, multi-state licensing, and ten consecutive years on the Top 500 Solar Contractors list as differentiators.', certifications=ARRAY['NABCEP','OSHA']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar EPC", "Solar site construction", "Feasibility studies", "Site evaluation", "Solar system design", "Energy storage installation", "Microgrid installation", "Electrical installation", "Mechanical installation", "Civil construction", "Design engineering", "Procurement", "Commissioning", "Operations and maintenance (O&M)", "NABCEP certification", "OSHA compliance", "Multi-state electrical licensing", "Multi-state civil construction licensing"], "industries": ["Commercial", "Industrial", "Municipal", "Utility", "Community solar"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "250 kW to 20 MW projects", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Mid-market specialist for 250 kW to 20 MW projects", "Turnkey EPC from development to O&M", "NABCEP and OSHA certified with multi-state licenses", "Over 110 skilled employees with workforce development programs", "Top 500 Solar Contractors for 10 consecutive years"], "facts_used": ["headquartered in Piedmont, South Dakota -> /about-us", "founded by Dwight Patterson in Rapid City, South Dakota -> /about-us", "privately held -> /about", "over 110 skilled employees -> /about-us", "224% growth from 2022 to 2024 -> /about-us", "Top 500 Solar Contractors for 10 consecutive years -> /about-us", "mid-market specialist for projects between 250 kW and 20 MW -> /about", "turnkey capabilities from development to post-install O&M -> /about", "NABCEP and OSHA certified, licensed across multiple states -> /about", "completed projects: Long Meadow Dairy, Norfolk Community Solar, City of Schuyler Phase III Solar, Clinton Solar