UPDATE companies SET description='Gilman Electric Supply operates from a single location at 128-B Center Street in Auburn, Maine, positioning itself as Androscoggin County''s electrical supplier of choice. The company is a member of the CED Family of Distributors, a national network that extends its reach beyond the local market. No founding year or ownership structure is publicly disclosed.

