UPDATE companies SET description='Good Shepherd Woodshop is based in Allen, Texas, where founder and head craftsman Joseph Timineri, together with co-founder and wife Crystal Timineri, launched a family-owned operation dedicated to heirloom-quality cutting boards. Crystal manages orders and customer relationships while contributing design direction, and the shop has grown into a local favorite known for its attention to detail and personal touch.

